+# Daily Grind
+
+Run `npm start` with Node.js 18 or newer to serve the homepage (default port 11222;
+override with `PORT`). `npm run build` checks JavaScript syntax without starting
+or importing the server.
+
+The newsletter form posts JSON to `/api/newsletter`. Valid signups are appended
+to `.data/newsletter.jsonl` on this server. Set `DATA_DIR` to a private persistent
+directory in production and retain that volume across deployments. The endpoint
+acknowledges success only after saving the email. It collects subscriptions;
+sending newsletters is a separate operation.
+
+Every response includes a Content Security Policy. Scripts, styles, connections,
+and form submissions are restricted to the same origin; images may additionally
+load from `https://images.unsplash.com`. Inline code, embedded frames, plugins,
+and base URL overrides are blocked. Keep executable assets on this origin trusted.
+The form reports failed, blocked, and timed-out requests in an accessible status
+message. Existing navigation destinations require separate pages/routes.
